  "description": "Popular YouTuber 'J', whose name and face are unknown. Minji is a high school student and a self-proclaimed fan of 'J'. Then one day, 'J' is accused of being an overnight burglar, and suspicion snowballs. So Minji can no longer just look at the injustice that is befalling her favorite idol! She promises to get rid of the accusations that J is suffering and starts to reason...\n\nWhat is the truth of this case?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6748367), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/67397962), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1746028521), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/my_bias), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/choeae_danger), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000071764)",
